1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,280
We were never taught how to be angry,

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,570
we were only taught how to hide it.

3
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:06,460
So the anger is not the problem.

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:07,920
Anger is information.

5
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,800
It tells you when a boundary has

6
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:10,540
been crossed,

7
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,660
when something matters to you deeply,

8
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,340
when you have been treated in a

9
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:16,100
way that does not sit right.

10
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:18,610
Feeling it does not make you a bad person.

11
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:20,170
It makes you honest.

12
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:23,050
Goal was never to stop feeling angry,

13
00:00:23,390 --> 00:00:25,090
but goal is to feel it,

14
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:27,250
name it and express it honestly.
